sub.example.com.        3600    IN      RRSIG   DNSKEY 3 3 3600 20070926135752 20070829135752 2854 sub.example.com. MCwCFBznBTYM/SrdUnjQdBnLtRO79KAaAhQReG5nRuL7Xsdf6D0KKwPa1GpWyQ== ;{id = 2854}
